      'Opening deal: 2-6 player(s), 8 card(s) per player, 1 deck(s), initial visibility face_down.',
      'Opening flow: start in deal; dealer may use perform_deal before bid.',
      "Scoring check: Each deal: card points (A=11, 10=10, K=4, Q=3, J=2) in tricks determine game score. Rubber: start at 24, subtract; first side to reach 0 wins the rubber. Expected outcome: Win the rubber by reducing your side's score from 24 to 0 before the opponents..",
